   <narrative xml:lang="FR">PIMS-9910 Biodiversity Finance Plan S&#xc3;O TOM&#xc9; AND PRINCIPE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Given the need for a comprehensive and multi-stakeholder strategic approach to resource mobilization, Target 19 requests all countries to develop national biodiversity finance plans (BFPs). These BFPs should assess the root causes of biodiversity loss, identify national biodiversity finance gaps, and articulate strategies on how to reduce the gaps through a suite of finance solutions aimed at reducing flow of resources that cause harm to biodiversity; generating additional resources; and enhanci</narrative>
  </description>
